1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,750
Meet Scriber. Keep what matters from meetings, calls, and videos.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:11,750
Click the menu bar icon, or press Option R, to open the panel.

3
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:17,100
Record system audio and your microphone, with separate controls.

4
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:21,750
Start recording, then get back to what you are doing.

5
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:28,650
See the timer and audio levels. Rename your file as you record.

6
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,650
Need the picture too? Choose screen recording.

7
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:36,950
Select a region, a window, or your whole screen.

8
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,700
Then stop and save.

9
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:44,550
Get a video with sound, plus a separate audio file.

10
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,700
Audio only? One M4A file.

11
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:51,100
Choose where your files go.

12
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:54,800
Play, rename, or find recordings in your history.

13
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:59,650
Scriber. Record it. Put it to work.
